                    {
                        "sense_id": "8bc72df4-24bc-30e6-8866-1f72edc36e23",
                        "entry_id": "63e47938-0901-3395-91bd-6d6e672031d0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ostentatious dress or behaviour employed by a man in an attempt to impress women."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "df5e521a-e2bd-4bf7-929a-3904e5120190",
                                "sense_id": "8bc72df4-24bc-30e6-8866-1f72edc36e23",
                                "text": "Peacocking may take place in legislatures and lodges, churches and chain stores. But it is particularly evident and bizarre in academia, a world where everyone is supposed to produce logically ordered exchanges of ideas."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49a1ab37-1bb5-463c-8838-054a40a215df",
                                "sense_id": "8bc72df4-24bc-30e6-8866-1f72edc36e23",
                                "text": "Men do it to get attention from women. Peacocking in pickup circles is pretty much a given. It's not for everyone and if you do decide to do it, you have to fully commit to it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a72f448-8cc8-487f-88bb-0065a71ba683",
                                "sense_id": "8bc72df4-24bc-30e6-8866-1f72edc36e23",
                                "text": "While you can decide for yourself if peacocking is your thing or not, I recommend you make a conscious effort to stand out from the crowd when you head out. If you dress like everyone else, you'll just blend into everyone else."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00c27690-7106-47a0-a412-a773715b3963",
                                "sense_id": "8bc72df4-24bc-30e6-8866-1f72edc36e23",
                                "text": "Brian: Quagmire told us to dress flashy so girls would notice us.\nStewie: Oh, right. Peacocking."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
